{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026aIp3X3DI5e1795057665.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>受強烈東北季候風影響，早上氣溫轉涼。</p><p></p><p>今早多處地區氣溫較昨日低三至四度左右，在九龍塘，有學生要穿上大褸保暖。天文台預測日間氣溫徘徊在21度左右，晚上天氣顯著轉涼，市區氣溫下降至午夜最低約18度，新界再低兩三度。周六漸轉天晴，早上仍然會相當清涼。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T04:24:06.282191+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T02:50:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T12:50:50.709186+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T04:17:17.835343+00:00","content_hash":"6f29bf58058ed4ed4eb9d8874a9ed1d0a3a0af52aae5cdaafcdaa73b458873c4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T04:24:06.282191+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}